    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>He, his name be damned, returneth yet again. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>With army of not men, but monstrosities, </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each bearing its own dread, its own curse.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In the ruins of his wake, some find meaning.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>So they speak of him:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HE WHO MAKES ALIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He calleth the fallen to stand once more. By some foul ordinance, he joins soul unto soul, birthing monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368410/extras/787f3692d8c6a9be13f2a69ec61076ae.poster.avif?t=1755629272\" width=628 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368410/extras/787f3692d8c6a9be13f2a69ec61076ae.webm?t=1755629272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368410/extras/787f3692d8c6a9be13f2a69ec61076ae.mp4?t=1755629272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>By chance, or by the very nature of souls, he crafts half-living. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each return, his creations grow stranger, wilder \u2014 and unholy beyond judgment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HE WHO RISES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancient writings tell \u2014 he cannot be slain in full. They say he bears the memory of ancient souls \u2014 wretched, forsaken souls who once fought on his side.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HE WHO KILLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Men who faced him whisper of his might. Some claim he commandeth a force unknown to man \u2014 by which he shifteth the tide of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368410/extras/70dd9a78b731feef25f70fa05490f725.poster.avif?t=1755629272\" width=628 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368410/extras/70dd9a78b731feef25f70fa05490f725.webm?t=1755629272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368410/extras/70dd9a78b731feef25f70fa05490f725.mp4?t=1755629272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They speak of curses most vile, of bursts of arcane flame \u2014 and how he mendeth and shifteth his abominations at will.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Or perhaps it is but a tale,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Whispered by old wives.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Maybe he doth not exist,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And reports are but lies,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Maybe our lords are fools,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Banners \u0421alled for naught.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Soon, we shall see.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>He, his name be damned, returneth yet again. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>With army of not men, but monstrosities, </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each bearing its own dread, its own curse.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In the ruins of his wake, some find meaning.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>So they speak of him:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HE WHO MAKES ALIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He calleth the fallen to stand once more. By some foul ordinance, he joins soul unto soul, birthing monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368410/extras/787f3692d8c6a9be13f2a69ec61076ae.poster.avif?t=1755629272\" width=628 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368410/extras/787f3692d8c6a9be13f2a69ec61076ae.webm?t=1755629272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368410/extras/787f3692d8c6a9be13f2a69ec61076ae.mp4?t=1755629272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>By chance, or by the very nature of souls, he crafts half-living. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each return, his creations grow stranger, wilder \u2014 and unholy beyond judgment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HE WHO RISES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancient writings tell \u2014 he cannot be slain in full. They say he bears the memory of ancient souls \u2014 wretched, forsaken souls who once fought on his side.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HE WHO KILLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Men who faced him whisper of his might. Some claim he commandeth a force unknown to man \u2014 by which he shifteth the tide of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368410/extras/70dd9a78b731feef25f70fa05490f725.poster.avif?t=1755629272\" width=628 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368410/extras/70dd9a78b731feef25f70fa05490f725.webm?t=1755629272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368410/extras/70dd9a78b731feef25f70fa05490f725.mp4?t=1755629272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They speak of curses most vile, of bursts of arcane flame \u2014 and how he mendeth and shifteth his abominations at will.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Or perhaps it is but a tale,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Whispered by old wives.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Maybe he doth not exist,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And reports are but lies,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Maybe our lords are fools,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Banners \u0421alled for naught.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Soon, we shall see.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Roguelike autobattler where you combine and fuse abilities to design your own army. Swarm the battlefield with weak units, dominate with a powerful juggernaut, or take control with global abilities to intervene in real-time. Expand your ability pool with each run and carve your own strategy.",
